# Performance

## Defaults

- Minimize unnecessary JavaScript and client hydration.
- Avoid unused dependencies; never add packages without an explicit need.
- Optimize images and static assets (appropriate format, dimensions, lazy loading when suitable).
- Prefer native browser functionality over libraries.
- Preserve accessibility while optimizing.

## Discipline

- Avoid premature optimization.
- Measure or verify performance claims when possible (Lighthouse, bundle analysis, network tab).
- Do not trade correctness or accessibility for micro-optimizations.
